<title>USA: Keene, N.H., won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Keene, N.H., won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it won $4.0 million of Keene, N.H., general obligationbonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1619 percent.</p>
